 # Slack GIF Creator
 
 A toolkit providing utilities and knowledge for creating animated GIFs optimized for Slack.
+
+<!-- LOCAL: Environment section below is a local addition not in upstream. Re-add after sync if clobbered. -->
+## Environment
+
+This skill ships with a local virtualenv. **Run all Python through it**, not system `python3`. Treat this `SKILL.md`'s directory as the skill root — all paths below are relative to it.
+
+```bash
+cd "$(dirname "$0")"  # or wherever this SKILL.md lives
+.venv/bin/python your_script.py
+```
 
+The `core.*` imports (`core.gif_builder`, `core.validators`, etc.) resolve relative to the skill directory, so `cd` into it before invoking — or set `PYTHONPATH` to that directory.
+
+If `.venv/` is missing, bootstrap it from the skill directory:
+```bash
+python3 -m venv .venv && .venv/bin/pip install -r requirements.txt
+```
+<!-- LOCAL END -->
